# Needs the dev test stock (TST) in a test save.
name the Sell dialog places a stop-loss: suggested stop, refused at or above today's price, shown in Your Portfolio
# the game's own Investments lists, whatever the "Investments list and research" flag says
investments-list off
set-price TST 100
run-days 1
show-buy TST
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 10
click Button
wait 1
show-sell TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-StopLossSell
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitCaption Stop price
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 90
expect-text Button Place stop-loss
expect-hidden PanelSellStats
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitEstimate Est. proceeds (at stop): ₡
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 120
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitEstimate Set the stop below today's price
click Button
expect-orders-delta 0
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 95
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitHint After a sharp drop it can sell for less
expect-no-overflow
capture stop-loss-ticket
click Button
expect-orders-delta 1
show-economy
wait 1
scroll-into-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-in-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order OwnedInvestmentsPanel
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order 10 shares if the price drops to ₡95
capture stop-loss-card
cleanup:
investments-list restore
cancel-new-orders
sell-back TST 10
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
close-economy
